<body>
<div class="app">
  <header>
    <h1>Backward Week Planner</h1>
    <p class="sub">Start with Friday outcomes, then map the week backward around focus blocks, energy, and constraints.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="topbar editorOnly">
    <div class="actions">
      <button id="buildBtn">Build week</button>
      <button class="secondary" id="printBtn">Print</button>
      <button class="secondary" id="copyBtn">Copy plan</button>
      <button class="secondary" id="exportTxtBtn">Export text</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <h2><span>Week setup</span><span class="pill" id="saveState">Saved locally</span></h2>
    <p class="hint">Nothing leaves this browser. Your plan is stored with localStorage.</p>
    <div class="grid two">
      <label>Friday date
        <input type="date" id="fridayDate">
      </label>
      <label>Buffer
        <select id="buffer">
          <option value="0">No buffer</option>
          <option value="10">10%</option>
          <option value="20">20%</option>
          <option value="30">30%</option>
          <option value="40">40%</option>
        </select>
      </label>
      <label>Daily overload line
        <input type="number" id="maxDayHours" min="1" max="16" step=".25">
      </label>
      <label>Task switch limit
        <input type="number" id="maxTasksDay" min="1" max="12" step="1">
      </label>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section editorOnly">
    <h2><span>Friday outcomes</span><button class="small secondary" id="addOutcome">Add</button></h2>
    <p class="hint">Use hours as the rough work needed before Friday. Higher priority gets placed first.</p>
    <div id="outcomes"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section editorOnly">
    <h2><span>Focus blocks</span><button class="small secondary" id="addBlock">Add</button></h2>
    <p class="hint">These are the available work containers. The planner fills them from Friday backward.</p>
    <div id="blocks"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section editorOnly">
    <h2><span>Energy windows</span><button class="small secondary" id="addEnergy">Add</button></h2>
    <p class="hint">High energy protects deep work. Low energy reduces usable capacity.</p>
    <div id="energy"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section editorOnly">
    <h2><span>Constraints</span><button class="small secondary" id="addConstraint">Add</button></h2>
    <p class="hint">Hard constraints remove time. Soft constraints cut that overlap in half.</p>
    <div id="constraints"></div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="planSection">
    <h2><span>Backward map</span><span class="pill dark mono" id="weekScore">Ready</span></h2>
    <div id="summaryBox" class="empty">Add outcomes and focus blocks, then build the week.</div>
    <div id="plan"></div>
    <div class="footerActions editorOnly">
      <button class="secondary" id="exportJsonBtn">Export JSON</button>
      <button class="secondary" id="exportCsvBtn">Export CSV</button>
      <button class="ghost" id="resetSampleBtn">Load sample</button>
      <button class="danger" id="clearBtn">Clear all</button>
    </div>
  </section>

